+---
+category: Bugfix
+authors: [YourGitHubUsername]
+---
+
+Fix budget totals going out of balance after moving, merging, hiding or deleting categories, when an expense category is filed under the income group, when holding funds on top of an automatic hold, when copying last month's budget, or when adding months to a budget that rolls over overspending
